# Role Permissions Reference

The `permissions` attribute on `thetalake_role` accepts permission strings in the `domain:action` format.

Use this page as the provider-side reference for valid values. The provider also validates requested permissions against the live `/roles/permissions` API endpoint, so `terraform plan` and `terraform apply` will fail if a value is no longer accepted by the API.

The list below is grouped by permission domain to keep it scannable.

